Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:04.79,Rainbow Star lyrics,,0,0,0,,Won't you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:06.69,Rainbow Star lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're fallen angels,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.69,0:01:09.40,Rainbow Star lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll fire arrows into your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.56,Rainbow Star lyrics,,0,0,0,,What color shall we add
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:47.44,Rainbow Star lyrics,,0,0,0,,into the cobalt blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.82,0:01:57.49,Rainbow Star lyrics,,0,0,0,,Destroy the sad reality that reflects in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:02:02.78,Rainbow Star lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's raise our wings, full of warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:04.74,Rainbow Star lyrics,,0,0,0,,Surreal fallen angels,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:07.56,Rainbow Star lyrics,,0,0,0,,singing from our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:39.20,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,2000)}原諒自己吧！\N佛朗基出航！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:44.56,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你們，關於騙人布的事想好了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.35,0:02:46.77,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這是尊嚴的問題……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.98,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你還要消沉到什麼時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:52.09,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:54.25,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,為什麼只有我是用畫的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:56.38,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,第一次就有這麼高的金額，真驚人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:03:00.78,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這張圖哪裡像我了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:03.15,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,明明跟你一模一樣……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:03.15,Secondary,Sanji,0,0,0,,這哪裡是我了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.15,0:03:04.62,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\b1}∆ □ x ∑ ≠ € җ Ө ☼{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:06.16,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我看不懂你說的話……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:10.47,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我會被全世界的女士們嘲笑的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.65,0:03:13.34,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我被騙了……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:15.43,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他說他是城裡的雜誌記者。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.47,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不過照片拍得挺可愛的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:20.89,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,畢竟我也被懸賞了……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:22.77,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我也是海賊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.86,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我可是像個真男人一樣戰鬥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:27.13,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,五十貝里我必須抗議！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.13,0:03:29.39,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那下次再加油吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.39,0:03:31.06,Main,Mozu and Kiwi,0,0,0,,快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:33.11,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,別忘了什麼東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:35.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,拿到船和佛朗基之後馬上出發！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:37.98,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,魯夫，香吉士不動。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:40.44,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那個捲眉毛的算了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:43.66,Main,Chimney,0,0,0,,你們要走了嗎，海賊們？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:47.49,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,真是例外中的例外呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:52.87,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,這麼小的船員全員都被懸賞，實在是……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:56.63,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,懸賞金合計超過六億了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:58.42,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,話說回來……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:01.20,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,這個叫黑腳的人……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:02.84,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,為什麼沒有照片？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:05.09,Main,Attach,0,0,0,,那個……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.09,0:04:07.22,Main,Attach,0,0,0,,我確實拍了，但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.22,0:04:09.48,Main,Attach,0,0,0,,看到沖洗出來的底片時，我嚇了一跳……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:11.27,Main,Attach,0,0,0,,這就是那張照片……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:13.81,Main,Attach,0,0,0,,拍出來好奇怪……！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:17.27,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,你有沒有拿掉……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:19.59,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,鏡頭蓋？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.17,Main,Mozu or Kiwi,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.17,0:04:26.24,Main,Mozu or Kiwi,0,0,0,,我們把他們叫來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.57,0:04:37.45,Main,Mozu or Kiwi,0,0,0,,大哥，你在哪裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:38.34,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,他們來了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:41.41,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,哦！那邊有個很大的東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:42.52,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,是那個嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.42,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嘿！我們來了，佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:45.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,請把船給我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:47.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,哦！冰山老頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.34,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你們來了……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.34,0:04:50.35,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,可惜，佛朗基不在……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:51.99,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,不過，船已經完成了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.99,0:04:53.58,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,我替他帶你們看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:57.17,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,這艘船很驚人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:05:01.40,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,看到那驚人的設計圖時我大吃一驚，是一艘能航行任何海域的船。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:04.80,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,有了這艘船，航行到世界盡頭不再是夢想。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:06.58,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,快讓我們看！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:07.66,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:10.91,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,那是佛朗基的留言，草帽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:13.50,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,如果你有一天要成為海賊王……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:19.20,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你就得騎上這頭百獸之王！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:22.32,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:23.60,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這是……？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.37,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,原來如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:29.60,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,哦！又大又帥！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.77,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好多地方可以探險！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:34.14,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,哦！你真的要把這個給我們嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.95,0:05:37.82,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,是梅利的兩倍大！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:39.63,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好大的帆！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:40.44,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,是單桅帆船嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:42.70,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,讓我看廚房！廚房！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.81,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,好壯觀的船！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.81,0:05:46.98,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,船首上那朵大花是什麼呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:49.95,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,嗯，我覺得那是獅子。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:52.12,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,裡面也好棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:53.87,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,是草坪甲板！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:54.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好舒服！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:56.51,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,有溜滑梯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.71,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,還可以園藝。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:00.42,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,適合放鬆。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.72,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,廚房在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:06.40,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那麼大的斜桁帆，機動力一定很強！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:08.59,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,那叫做雙桅橫帆。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:13.12,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,單桅帆船是一艘能超越人們想像航行的船。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:15.52,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,它的生死全憑航海士的指令。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:18.69,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,我會讓我的技術大顯身手！我會全力以赴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:20.71,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我也想看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:25.30,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,有我夢寐以求的帶鎖冰箱！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:27.24,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,還有超大的烤爐！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:28.79,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,佛朗基，謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:31.16,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這艘船是最棒的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:33.85,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嘿，冰山老頭。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:35.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,佛朗基在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.54,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我想謝謝他。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.17,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,他好像不想見你們。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:44.05,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你想邀請他當你們的船匠對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:44.96,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,對。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:46.41,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你猜對了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:49.22,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我決定他就是我們的船匠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:50.81,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,問題可能就在這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.41,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他不願意嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:53.71,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,正好相反。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:57.41,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,如果被當面邀請，他無法拒絕。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.07,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,所以他才去躲起來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:03.94,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,嗯，也許他的真心話是想跟你們一起出海。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:09.05,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你一定知道他對這艘送給你們的夢想之船傾注了多少心血。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:12.08,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,哦！這裡有水族箱？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.53,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,水族箱？好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:18.79,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,佛朗基打從心底喜歡你們所有人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:24.12,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,但他一直認為留在這座島上是他的責任。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:25.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,責任？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:30.75,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,確實，依我看來，那不過是愚蠢的執念。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:35.72,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,如果你們真的想讓他跟你們走……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:38.18,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,唯一的方法是……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:40.40,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,用強制手段帶走他。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:44.35,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,那是解放他的唯一方法。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.35,0:07:45.98,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,用強制的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:48.82,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我希望他一起來，但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:51.70,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那樣真的可以嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:57.49,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,大哥！你怎麼回來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.36,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我需要理由嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.36,0:08:02.00,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這裡是佛朗基之家！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:02.66,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,是我的家！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:04.58,Main,Kiev,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:06.71,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,大哥你確定嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:11.16,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,大哥難道不想跟\N草帽先生他們一起走嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:14.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,別說傻話了……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.87,0:08:17.42,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,當然不想……！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:18.65,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,嘿你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.65,0:08:22.43,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,就你那手藝連房子都蓋不好。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:26.39,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們剛才去拜託了\N草帽先生他們，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:28.67,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,請他們帶大哥出海！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.18,0:08:30.19,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:31.19,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,多管閒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.19,0:08:35.61,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,但那傢伙已經決定要你當他的船匠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:39.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我為什麼要變成海賊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:41.20,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,你看了就會知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:45.58,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,這是我們第一次看大哥造船，但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:49.65,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們驚訝於你能露出那麼幸福的表情。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:53.76,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我從沒看過大哥那麼開心。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.41,0:08:56.36,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,大哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:09:02.72,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,你知道草帽他們在找船匠的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.89,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,所以你才逃走的對吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.18,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,看看這個，大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.54,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,通緝令！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:11.36,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,果然出來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:14.03,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,留在我們身邊已經沒用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.03,0:09:18.45,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們不想成為你的累贅！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.82,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,別太自大了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:22.54,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,海軍怎麼辦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:27.66,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,當初你快死的時候，是我從這些後街把你撿回來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:31.17,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,如果我不在，你們大概連活都活不下去……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:35.39,Main,Tamagon,0,0,0,,我搶到他的褲子了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:36.39,Main,Kiev,0,0,0,,褲子？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:37.89,Main,Kiev,0,0,0,,為什麼是褲子……？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:39.30,Main,Random FF Member,0,0,0,,我明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:39.98,Main,Random FF Member,0,0,0,,不要還他！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:40.67,Main,Random FF Member,0,0,0,,繼續傳褲子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.67,0:09:41.72,Main,Random FF Member,0,0,0,,無論如何都不要還他！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:44.47,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,把褲子還我，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:49.00,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那是我最好的一條！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:49.98,Main,FF Members,0,0,0,,散開！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:51.90,Main,FF Members,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:55.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,隨你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:57.84,Main,FF Members,0,0,0,,他追過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:02.77,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們知道就算是你們也對付不了我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:05.69,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,即使只有一個人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:07.56,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,把它們送到草帽先生那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:09.99,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,送去廢料島！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:17.67,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}強力右拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:23.42,Main,FF Guy,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:24.39,Main,FF Guy,0,0,0,,往東南方！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:33.52,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,怎麼這麼吵？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:34.94,Main,Rich Citizen/Uncle Sam,0,0,0,,變態……！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:37.65,Main,Rich Citizen/Uncle Sam,0,0,0,,佛朗基在暴走！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:40.79,Main,Fat Citizen,0,0,0,,又來了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:43.39,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,不！城鎮可能會被毀掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:48.52,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,等等，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:51.36,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,嘿！那傢伙什麼都沒穿！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:04.00,Main,Little Girl,0,0,0,,啊！看那個……！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:05.62,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,讓小孩子進屋裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:07.04,Main,Stache Man,0,0,0,,別讓他們看到變態！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:09.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}強力右拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:21.70,Main,Policeman,0,0,0,,他在犯罪，逮捕他！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.81,0:11:34.92,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,把、把褲子送出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:40.99,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,上管嘴魚！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:42.39,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,好！走！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:49.90,Main,Person,0,0,0,,後街變成戰場了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.15,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,可惡，我的腿……！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.61,0:11:53.69,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,沒用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:55.18,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,就是這裡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:11:57.65,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嘿！傳給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:04.41,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,丟過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:07.36,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,草帽先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:10.27,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:18.00,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,確實收到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:20.51,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你……！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:23.55,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:26.22,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你喜歡那艘船嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:27.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喜歡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:31.12,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我從沒見過這麼厲害的船！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:32.23,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:35.24,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,變態！滾出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.24,0:12:36.26,Main,Man,0,0,0,,判他死刑！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:37.23,Main,Man,0,0,0,,變態混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:40.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,當然！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:42.51,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那包含了我的超級設計！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:45.91,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,它滿足了你們所有的要求！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:48.49,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你看到我發明的船塢系統了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:52.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,還沒！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:54.84,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你一定會最喜歡那個的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:57.68,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,魚池呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.68,0:12:58.63,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我看到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:03.58,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,把釣到的魚放進魚池裡，就能在下面房間的大水族箱裡看到。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:06.38,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那是水族觀賞室！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:08.88,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,大家一定要在那裡吃一次飯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:11.19,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你隨時都能吃到新鮮的魚！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:12.47,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好期待！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:18.16,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那艘船，對我和對你們來說都是……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:19.77,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,最高的夢想之船！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:22.56,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你這混蛋……！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:25.74,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,把我褲子還來！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:30.08,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.37,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:37.38,Main,Kiev,0,0,0,,他、他來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:39.00,Main,Kiev,0,0,0,,拜託你了羅羅亞先生和另一位！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:40.09,Main,Sanji and Zoro,0,0,0,,交給我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.55,Main,Sanji and Zoro,0,0,0,,上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:53.06,Main,Kiev,0,0,0,,目標：廢料島！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.52,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們想幹嘛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.62,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,佛朗基家族特製！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:58.81,Main,Kiev,0,0,0,,隨機發射炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:14:00.95,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,嘿、嘿你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.95,0:14:02.49,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,別開玩笑……！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:14.96,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他沒去追褲子，先追到這裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:16.66,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,抓住，喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:19.67,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:21.88,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}火箭！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:24.54,Main,Old Man,0,0,0,,什麼鬼東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.54,0:14:26.84,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,笨蛋！那只是那個變態！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:32.76,Main,Chimney,0,0,0,,{\i1)}繭！繭！繭！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:32.29,Secondary,Mozu and Kiwi,0,0,0,,大、大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:34.68,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,這是什麼情況？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:41.80,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:45.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,謝謝你造的船！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:47.16,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,是最棒的船！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:48.74,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們會好好珍惜的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.18,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:54.20,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,祝你們一路平安。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.08,0:14:57.87,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,如果你想要回這條褲子，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:00.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,就得成為我們的夥伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:18.65,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,穿上你的褲子！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.65,0:15:19.52,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,變態！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:22.03,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,他又把城市毀了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.65,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,滾出去，變態！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.49,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.03,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,把褲子還我，草帽。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:32.79,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那就加入我們的船員。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.00,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,別說蠢話！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:38.42,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不要以為拿了我的褲子就能讓我當你的夥伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,1080,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}那
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,1080,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,1080,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}什
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,1080,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,1080,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,1080,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.98,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,1080,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}男
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,1080,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,1080,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}就
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}算
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}赤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}裸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}體
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}也
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}對
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.28,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}無
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:55.57,Captions,Franky,0,1080,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(50,1000}數
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:02.14,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,他決定下半身全裸擺姿勢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.77,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,不要看！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:04.97,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,太糟糕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:06.24,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,他是最糟的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:07.88,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我小看他了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:10.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,多麼堅定！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:12.15,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他是男人中的男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:15.24,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他只是個變態！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:18.85,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,如果可以稍微粗暴一點的話……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:20.20,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我能幫個忙嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:25.17,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二輪花！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:25.17,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}二輪花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.03,0:16:42.28,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}抓住！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:49.06,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,欸？！等一下，羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:51.91,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,被抓住了！好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:54.91,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,會被捏碎的，羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:02.84,Main,One of Square Sist.,0,0,0,,會被扯掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:05.21,Main,One of Square Sist.,0,0,0,,會被拔掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:07.67,Main,Mozu and Kiwi,0,0,0,,就像剝橘子一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:08.93,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嘿，羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:11.43,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我希望他成為夥伴的時候還是個男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:12.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不要拔掉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:14.59,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,光看就痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:19.61,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.61,0:17:22.48,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,佛朗基在受傷！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:25.73,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,什麼？那叫聲就像雞被綁住脖子一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.99,0:17:28.72,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,我為他感到心疼。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:29.90,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,雖然他是個變態。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:34.12,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,就像寶藏擺在海賊面前卻不想放手一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:36.71,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,如果我沒有收到一個好理由，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:38.36,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我不會放開你。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:40.74,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,所、所以……！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:45.94,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我說了我不能離開這座島……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:50.27,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我很感謝你們……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:53.53,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,但這對我來說是不可能的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:55.70,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我想跟你們走但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:59.64,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我在這裡還有必須做的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:04.28,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,所以我才把船送給你們。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:07.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我本來就已經不造船了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:12.22,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,所以，那一艘是我唯一會再造的船。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:13.27,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我只有一個願望……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:16.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那就是……那邊那艘夢想之船！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:18.52,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,等等，佛朗基……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:23.37,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,那艘船還沒有成為你說的夢想之船。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.65,Flashbacks,Young Iceburg,0,0,0,,夢想之船？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.65,0:18:28.67,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:32.09,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,那艘船不是光靠設計圖就能完成的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.55,0:18:35.70,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,它要航行過很多海域！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:38.05,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,克服很多戰鬥和困難……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:41.65,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,等到它抵達大海的盡頭……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.65,0:18:45.27,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,那時候才能稱為夢想之船！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:51.57,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,那麼，等到有一天我完成了那艘厲害的船，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.57,0:18:54.95,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,我要登上它成為它的船匠！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:57.98,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,我期待看到那命運之日！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.98,0:19:01.01,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,到那時候船可能已經傷痕累累了，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:05.50,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,但一定會比其他任何船都更加閃耀！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:08.18,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？很厲害吧，湯姆先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:09.88,Flashbacks,Tom,0,0,0,,嗯，很厲害。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:12.35,Flashbacks,Tom,0,0,0,,而且如果你登上它照顧它的話……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:13.66,Flashbacks,Tom,0,0,0,,你就會超越我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:16.96,Flashbacks,Young Kokoro,0,0,0,,這就是你的海賊血統。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.85,0:19:21.51,Flashbacks,Young Iceburg,0,0,0,,蠢朗基，你真的以為你能超越湯姆先生嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.51,0:19:22.31,Flashbacks,Young Franky,0,0,0,,你說什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:23.87,Flashbacks,Young Iceburg,0,0,0,,混蛋！你在幹嘛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.87,0:19:25.45,Flashbacks,Young Iceburg,0,0,0,,可惡的蠢朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:30.71,Flashbacks,Tom,0,0,0,,怎麼了，如果你是男子漢就堂堂正正來！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:36.27,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我想做的事情已經變了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.63,0:19:37.73,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你想做的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:39.06,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,不對。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.43,0:19:44.21,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你現在，已經做完了在這座島上該做的一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:46.41,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,贖罪！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.47,0:19:53.87,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,那天……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.87,0:19:58.88,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你自責並後悔讓湯姆先生被抓走。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.46,0:20:06.81,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,但湯姆先生早已原諒你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:09.90,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,為你指出了新的道路。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:15.60,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你從後街收集了一群混混，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:18.58,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,打響了賞金獵人的名號，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:21.78,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,保護這座島不被掠奪者侵擾，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.56,0:20:26.55,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你保護了湯姆先生深愛的這座水之都的一切，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.55,0:20:29.49,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,全都是為了贖你的罪。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.89,0:20:33.21,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,也許你不這麼看。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:35.94,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我當然不這麼看……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:38.87,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我完全沒有那個意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:43.90,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你放棄了你喜歡的造船來繼續活著。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.93,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,你打算今後也一直這樣下去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:48.05,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,即使湯姆先生已經原諒了你，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:50.16,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,即使我也已經原諒了你，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:52.03,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,什麼都不會改變，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:53.64,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,是時候了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.95,0:20:58.66,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,原諒你自己吧，佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:09.79,Main,Iceburg,0,0,0,,現在為你的夢想而活吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:27.55,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼……？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.43,0:21:32.56,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,袋子？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:36.22,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,那是你的旅行行李，大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:37.28,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,讓開，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.28,0:21:39.31,Main,Citizens,0,0,0,,啊！佛朗基家族！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:40.62,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:41.49,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.53,0:21:44.95,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那些傢伙……！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:51.67,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,大哥，請原諒我們所做的一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:53.04,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們真的很抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:54.73,Main,Franky Family,0,0,0,,真的很對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:57.23,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們準備好接受任何懲罰了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:21:59.01,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們是笨蛋，所以……！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:02.63,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們只能想到這個辦法！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.43,0:22:06.65,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們在打什麼主意？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:09.03,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,偷我褲子的計畫？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.42,0:22:12.80,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,把我變成海賊的計畫？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:14.61,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,別插手！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.61,0:22:16.08,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這是我的人生！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:18.56,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,一切由我決定！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.40,0:22:24.62,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們這些手下逼我走的這條路讓你們開心嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.62,0:22:26.23,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,太丟人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:28.05,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,如果你們想清楚了，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:30.93,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,一開始就不該這麼做！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:33.67,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,沒有藉口可說但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:37.39,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們稍微關心一下你不行嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.39,0:22:41.43,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,對那個把我們這些掠奪者撿起來的人……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.67,0:22:46.03,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,關心你的幸福不行嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.15,0:22:55.36,Main,Kokoro,0,0,0,,到底誰才是笨蛋？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.61,0:22:58.64,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.06,0:23:05.49,Main,Mozu and Kiwi,0,0,0,,大、大哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.08,0:23:10.52,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嘿！羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.52,0:23:12.68,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,請不要太過分！拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:14.23,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他會變成女人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.23,0:23:15.70,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他在哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:18.44,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,可惡，妮可·羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:20.08,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我不會原諒你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.64,0:23:24.32,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,痛到我停不住眼淚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.32,0:23:25.20,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.83,0:23:29.59,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你停手了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.52,0:23:35.14,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我只不過是開了個頭而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.27,0:23:37.69,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,他還真聰明。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:40.06,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,把那些淚水歸咎於疼痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.95,0:23:42.57,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,只是開了個頭？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.35,0:23:44.61,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.22,0:23:50.87,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我停不住哭了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.82,0:23:55.89,Main,Franky Family,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.89,0:23:58.13,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.58,0:24:02.55,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,怎麼可能沒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:05.04,Flashbacks,Past FF,0,0,0,,你好像沒注意到……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:07.97,Flashbacks,Young Zambai,0,0,0,,這個穿泳褲的傢伙是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.97,0:24:11.26,Flashbacks,Young Zambai,0,0,0,,你不該出現在這些後街。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.80,0:24:14.73,Flashbacks,Thug,0,0,0,,乂白！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.73,0:24:22.64,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,從今以後，水之七島的後街由佛朗基掌管！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.64,0:24:23.69,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,幸會！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.99,0:24:25.65,Flashbacks,Young Zambai,0,0,0,,是、是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.98,0:24:30.30,Main,Mozu and Kiwi,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.91,0:24:35.12,Flashbacks,Young Square Sis,0,0,0,,啊！這個不錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.14,0:24:40.17,Flashbacks,Young Square Sis,0,0,0,,我們下次再來。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.87,0:24:43.55,Flashbacks,Young Square Sis,0,0,0,,是個穿著泳褲外出的大哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.55,0:24:46.13,Flashbacks,Young Square Sis,0,0,0,,要不要一起喝一杯？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.13,0:24:48.84,Flashbacks,Young Square Sis,0,0,0,,我們帶你去酒吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.38,0:24:55.10,Flashbacks,Young Square Sis,0,0,0,,你、你們在幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.10,0:24:56.37,Flashbacks,Young Square Sis,0,0,0,,放開我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.37,0:25:00.48,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,小女孩大白天不該喝酒！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.81,0:25:05.74,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,我剛好知道一家不錯的店可以喝到好喝的可樂。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.45,0:25:07.16,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.16,0:25:08.45,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,想去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.45,0:25:12.40,Main,Franky Family,0,0,0,,大哥！大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.62,0:25:22.33,Flashbacks,Homeless Man,0,0,0,,食物……拜託了……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.70,0:25:26.84,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,沒吃飯的傢伙們，跟我來！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.01,0:25:36.28,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,想怎麼鬧就怎麼鬧！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.28,0:25:38.72,Flashbacks,Franky,0,0,0,,佛朗基家族成立了！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.15,0:25:55.11,Flashbacks,Franky Family,0,0,0,,{\i1}佛朗基！佛朗基！佛朗基！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.69,0:26:02.83,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:06.69,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,如果我不在，你們怎麼活下去……？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.69,0:26:08.08,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,大哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.70,0:26:12.76,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們會在水之七島挑戰新的工作來證明自己的實力……！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:15.13,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,我們一定會成功的！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.13,0:26:16.47,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,請放心！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.47,0:26:17.73,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,大哥，別哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.73,0:26:19.10,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.10,0:26:21.92,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,就算大哥去了很遠的地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.92,0:26:25.49,Main,FF Member,0,0,0,,我們永遠都是你的手下！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.49,0:26:27.06,Main,Franky Family,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.82,0:26:33.55,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我停不住哭……！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.17,0:26:38.14,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.14,0:26:39.37,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,糟糕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.36,0:26:41.87,Main,Zoro and Sanji,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.39,0:26:45.81,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆，香吉士。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.43,0:26:47.79,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,大事不好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.15,0:26:51.31,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你爺爺回來了，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.31,0:26:55.51,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他在對面的海岸安排進攻，正在找我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.51,0:26:57.40,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,啊？！為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.40,0:26:59.47,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他不是決定不抓我們了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.94,0:27:01.57,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我們怎麼知道？！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.57,0:27:03.35,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,快準備出發！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.44,0:27:07.39,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,佛朗基！混蛋，你還沒穿褲子嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.39,0:27:09.21,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,給你！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.80,0:27:15.98,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好了，上船吧，佛朗基。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.98,0:27:17.53,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,上我的船。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.89,0:27:21.48,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,別那麼囂張！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.48,0:27:24.76,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們這些業餘人士能做的修理只是便宜貨。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.76,0:27:28.85,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,如果這艘出色的船上沒有一個船匠的話……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.85,0:27:30.41,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我會替這艘船感到可憐。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.68,0:27:31.81,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,沒辦法。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.81,0:27:33.37,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我就幫你們一把吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.37,0:27:35.65,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們船的船匠……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.65,0:27:38.09,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,就由偉大的佛朗基來當！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.47,0:27:41.55,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！新夥伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.80,0:27:44.10,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.60,0:27:48.80,Main,Mozu and Kiwi,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.21,0:27:49.98,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,別哭……！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.98,0:27:51.33,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,不要哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.33,0:27:54.27,Main,Zambai,0,0,0,,草帽先生是個值得信賴的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.61,0:28:03.94,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,湯姆先生……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.94,0:28:06.67,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我……要離開這座島了……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.85,0:28:14.81,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我只不過是個麻煩的學生，不過……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.05,0:28:18.56,Flashbacks,Citizen,0,0,0,,你聽說了嗎，廢料島的消息？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.56,0:28:22.11,Flashbacks,Citizen,0,0,0,,湯姆的工人完成海上列車了，你說？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.22,0:28:25.74,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,謝謝您一直以來的照顧！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.48,0:28:32.06,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,卡雷拉公司的首席船匠們。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.81,0:28:35.02,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,冰山，拜託你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.58,0:28:38.99,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你也是個麻煩的學生呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.24,0:28:41.62,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,可可羅婆婆……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.62,0:28:42.95,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,小傢伙們……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.47,0:28:45.46,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,橫綱……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:46.71,Main,Citizens,0,0,0,,變態！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.89,0:28:48.65,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,活力充沛的居民們……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.89,0:28:48.24,Secondary,Citizens,0,0,0,,你要去哪裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.24,0:28:49.41,Secondary,Citizens,0,0,0,,你會回來吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.20,0:28:51.28,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我的妹妹們……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.42,0:28:55.82,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,索多姆。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.82,0:28:56.84,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,歌摩拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.82,0:28:58.78,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,還有……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.81,0:29:01.80,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我親愛的手下們！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.82,0:29:28.08,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我暫時離開了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.64,0:29:34.30,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,穿上你的褲子。
Comment: 0,0:00:00.42,0:00:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,

